OL,3,GNEWSAM1 reopens after lorry overturned
OL,4,Aon to barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M1 in Leicestershire has reopened
OL,7,Fafter a lorry overturned on to the
OL,8,Fcentral reservation barrier.
OL,10,FAt about 05:30 BST on Friday, National
OL,11,FHighways said the motorway was shut in
OL,12,Fboth directions between junction 24 at
OL,13,FKegworth and junction 23A for East
OL,14,FMidlands Airport, later changing on the
OL,15,Fsouthbound side to affect junctions 23A
OL,16,Fand 23.
OL,18,FThe lorry was recovered from the scene
OL,19,Ffollowing a "complex" operation, which
OL,20,Ftook place throughout the morning.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
