OL,3,GNEWSAM1 reopens after lorry overturned
OL,4,Aon to barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe highways agency said residual
OL,7,Fdelays were still affecting the roads
OL,8,Fwith an hour delay on the M1
OL,9,Fsouthbound, 40 minutes on the
OL,10,Fnorthbound side and hour-long delays on
OL,11,Fthe A42 northbound.
